window.products.push({"id":997010,"name":"FAHUA Thick Couch Covers for 3 Cushion Couch 1-Piece Stretch Sofa Cover Slipcover Jacquard Non-Slip Furniture Protector for Dogs Pets Kids (Large, Cre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713ZKVDk64L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THICKENED MATERIAL: Unlike any other ordinary sofa covers, FAHUA couch covers are made by advanced jacquard machine and exquisite workmanship. Featuring spandex blend material, our slipcover’s fabric has been thickened and are woven together very tightly, so it’s designed specifically for extra durability, not easy to be ripped while soft to touch and comfortable. PERFECT FIT: We offer 4 sizes of furniture covers which are suitable for most sofas. Small size (30-47 inch), Medium size (56-70 inch), Large size (71-92 inch), X-Large size (93-115 inch). Please measure your sofa from arm to arm before ordering. Installation and measuring guide of furniture protector is displayed in the product pictures. If you have any questions, please contact us and we are willing to help you. PET-FRIENDLY & FRESH NEW LOOK: This 1-Piece thick sofa cover is an ideal slipcover for pet owners as it’s hard to scratch through. Even pet hair will not stick on it and can be easily removed. Not only protects your sofa from accidents, spills, daily stains such as grease, but also offers excellent resistance to wear and tear and fading. Various vivid colors are also available for you to choose according to the atmosphere of the room. HIGH STRETCH AND STAY IN PLACE: These couch cover for dogs are super stretchy due to its premium fabric, suitable for most type of couches, such as Lawson sofa, T-cushion sofa, roll arm sofa, etc. Highly recommend for both cloth and leather couch. Simply tuck anti-slip styrofoams in to make couch slip cover stay in place, more smooth and wrinkle-free. Non-skid elastic bottom also promises a full coverage. EASY MAINTENANCE: Our sofa slip cover is easy to care. Hand wash or machine washable in cold water. Tumble dry and do not bleach. Due to the diverse light and monitor display, colors may slightly differ from picture and product. 100% satisfaction is our promise to you. If you are not happy with our couch cover, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713ZKVDk64L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FAHUA","source_asin":"B0839CSCPY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-997010","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0839CSCPY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0839CSCPY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
