window.products.push({"id":997112,"name":"Cocktail Smoker Kit with Torch,4 Different Smoke Wood Chips,fits Cocktails,Whisky,Wine,Meat,etc.Perfect Gift for Father/Husband/Self(No Butane)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Y3ZpEEp4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★Cocktail Smoker Suit: Cocktail smokers are carved from solid oak. All processes: hollowing out and polishing are hand-made by skilled craftsmen. Hizle cocktail cigarette gift box contains 4 flavors of Natural Smoked fuel, apple wood, cherry wood, walnut, oak, With Butane torch and exquisite packaging gift box. ★Safety Environmental Protection: Our smoked fuel is handmade from pure natural wood and spices. The wood is air dried to 7% humidity, then made into fine flakes or small pieces, and finally slightly baked to optimize the flavor extracted from the wood. We guarantee that there are no harmful additives. ★Whisky-Cocktail Smoker: Smoked cocktail is not only a good helper for making cocktails, but also a table art. It can also be used for meat production and cheese salad. It can not only enhance the flavor of food and spirits, but also impress people. ★Precautions use: Put the smoke box on the cup port, add natural smoke fuel, and then ignite it with the attached butane torch. The smoke will flow into the cup from the small hole at the bottom. When wine or food contacts and absorbs the smoke, it will produce a soft smoke smell. When using the attached butane torch, please pay attention to safety and control the fire a little! 🎁Man's Gift: The smoky cocktail set gift box contains 4 kinds of pure natural smoky fuels (apple,cherry, walnut,oak), 2 filters,1 Butane Torch（No Butane）,spoons and brushes. Beautiful packaged gift which is very suitable for husbands, fathers or friends. They will like it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Y3ZpEEp4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hizle","source_asin":"B09PFZNV36","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-997112","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PFZNV36","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PFZNV36","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
