window.products.push({"id":997199,"name":"PAVILIA Travel Blanket and Pillow Set, Airplane Blanket Compact 2-in-1 Soft Bag, Travel Essentials for Adult Flight, Portable Throw with Arm Hole, Pla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YaZHp+TBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TRAVEL PILLOW & BLANKET SET: This portable travel blanket set, including a soft and silky microfleece blanket and a convertible pillowcase, is a must-have accessory for flying and an essential for international travelers on long flights. It is designed for various travel situations such as airplane trips, car rides, road trips, camping, emergencies, and can also be used at home or in the office. COMPACT TRAVEL BLANKET AND PILLOW: This versatile travel blanket can be easily folded and transformed into a compact carrying case. The convenient carrying bag doubles as a comfortable pillow, providing neck support while you rest. It is perfect for travel as it can be effortlessly carried around or conveniently stored at home without taking up much space. SILKY SOFT MICROFLEECE BLANKET: Crafted with high-grade 100% premium microfleece polyester, this lightweight and durable travel throw blanket ensures exceptional comfort during your journeys. Its plush and thick texture offers warmth and coziness, making it ideal for keeping you comfortable and warm on long, chilly flights. Its texture is also soft to touch, making it a cozy travel essential and accessory for any travel plans. FUNCTIONAL & CONVENIENT: The lightweight travel blanket bag features a luggage sleeve, allowing you to securely attach the blanket to your luggage or suitcase. Additionally, it includes a rear zipper pocket to store your travel essentials such as your passport, plane ticket, phone, and more. When opened up as a blanket, it features arm hole openings with magnetic closure design that ensures easy slip-on use and full arm mobility during flight and plane travel. EASY TO CARE, MACHINE WASHABLE PLANE BLANKET: This travel pillow and blanket set is easy to maintain. Wash separately in cold water; Tumble Dry Low. Our blanket gets softer with each wash. It measures 65 x 40 inches when unfolded as a blanket, making it suitable for adults. When converted into a packable backpack pillow, it measures 11 x 12 inches, making it lightweight for travel. This blanket set makes an ideal gift for travelers, adults, men, and women of all ages.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YaZHp+TBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PAVILIA","source_asin":"B0BLHXPMXY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-997199","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLHXPMXY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLHXPMXY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
