window.products.push({"id":997425,"name":"RingHum Digital Projection Alarm Clock, Radio Alarm Clock with Projection on Ceiling Wall, USB Charger, 0-100% Dimmer, Battery Backup Dual Alarm Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UaTo-mD4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"📺Ceiling Projection Alarm Clock: RingHum projection clock project the time onto the wall or ceiling, so sleepers don’t have to roll over when checking it. With a 180° swivel projector, so you can control where the time is displayed. 4 projection levels bring fine and smooth temporal graphic images on walls or ceilings. 💡5inch LED Alarm Clock with 0-100% Dimmer: The clear LED screen of the ceiling projection alarm clock enables you to easily view the time even across the room even with glasses off and perfectly for elders. By turning the adjustment wheel, you can set the brightness of the display to any level from bright to very dim to accommodate your different needs. 💤5 Alarm Sounds & 2 Alarms: RingHum alarm clock has five ringtones, which include ocean waves, chord music, bird’s singing, beep, along with a FM radio. Just select your favorite one to softly and slowly wake you up. Setting two alarms at once isn’t a problem, so you and your partner have separate alarms without disrupting another. 📅Clock Radio with Sleep Timer: If you prefer music, you can use the built-in FM radio that allows up to 30 preset stations. Besides, you will be intrigued by its 90-minute maximum sleep timer function. As it allows you to play music while you are try to fall asleep for a set time before it turns off automatically. Press the big SNOOZE button on top to get an extra 9 minutes of sleep. 🔌 Projection Alarm Clock with USB Charging Port: RingHum clock radios for bedroom is very convenient for charging Android and iOS cellphones, tablets with built-in 5V/1.0A USB output interface. Feel at ease to sleep you will find your cellphone is fully charged when you wake up. And it comes with a battery backup system for time and radio memory during power outages, which is very convenient during storms.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UaTo-mD4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RingHum","source_asin":"B09YLS96ZY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-997425","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YLS96ZY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YLS96ZY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
