window.products.push({"id":997453,"name":"Executive Office Chair Big and Tall Reclining Leather Computer Chair High Back Desk Chair Ergonomic for Lumbar Support with Angle Recline Locking Syst","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71raJJ+2KTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【ADJUSTABLE FUNCTION】 This leather office chair features up to 3.7 inches height adjustment, from 90° to 125° tilt adjustment, and flip-adjust armrests. The lock and loose system under the seat can lock at any angle you need, which can guarantee stability and safety. It allows you to get comfortable way easily whenever you are working , relaxing and gaming. 【Ergonomic Support】 Our leather computer chairs have a humanized design with a Well-padded Soft Cushion, Curved Lumbar and Armrests Support. When you are sat for prolonged periods a well-designed and ergonomic chair is needed and important for reducing your lumbar spine pain, relaxing your brain and increasing productivity. Every detail design starts from your experience and comes for your enjoyment. 【Bonded Leather Material】 This executive chair is designed to be made of bonded leather, providing comfort sitting experience. High-density headrest and backrest with built-in lumbar support, seat cushions relieve pressure from the legs while providing cushioning for long workdays. 【Easy to Assemble】 The heavy-duty desk chair has a 250-pound weight capacity. With the detailed instructions and tools included in the package, you can easily assemble the chair by yourself in a short time. Get ready for your superior workspace! 【Satisfaction Guarantee】 We are extremely happy with our product, therefore we offer a 12 months warranty and additionally a 30 day no questions asked refund policy for all our customers.What’s more, if you need help for assembling or using our product, please feel free to contact our customer support team.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71raJJ+2KTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZUNMOS","source_asin":"B09J24RVQM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-997453","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J24RVQM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J24RVQM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":997454,"name":"ASEBBO Original Lunch Tote – Large Insulated Waxed Canvas Lunch Bag for Women, 10L Reusable Thermal Lunch Box, Cute Modern Luxury Cooler, For Work – F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813eBKUiu1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LUXURY LUNCH BAG FOR WOMEN: Aesthetic and eye-catching, the Asebbo Original Lunch Tote is a best Gift for Mom and Dad, Wife, Daughter, Sister or a Friend. Unique Waxed Canvas material adds a luxury feel while providing waterproof protection for your snacks during the rainy days. Stylish and fashionable accessory for all adult - unisex. This vintage-inspired insulated lunch bag is suitable with any look, from professional business to relaxed casual to cute kawaii. STYLISH LARGE LUNCH TOTE: Larger than most competitors, this lunchbox fits up to 10L of items – and holds up to 22 pounds! (10kg). You can carry all your warm and cold food containers, water bottle, beverage cans, fruits and snacks while maintaining your cute and professional look. Additional zippered pocket holds your mobile phone, wallet, and other items. 100% leakproof and waterproof thanks to thick aluminum foil, with BPA-free materials. KEEPS FRESH AND INSULATED: Specifically crafted thick and strong aluminum foil in ASEBBO Original Lunch Tote keeps your lunch either cold or hot for up to 4-6 hrs – and fresh for the entire day. Designed with a strong zipper and genuine leather zip puller, this women lunch box efficiently seals the food to support you for a full day. Always eat fresh! BEST FOR FAMILY OUTINGS: This spacious tote has plenty of room for snacks for family and friends to be used also outside the office. Perfect for picnics, events, parties, and trips out! With the square, design, sturdy material and leakproof insulation, it is suitable also for bottles – allowing you to take your bottles out without sacrificing your style. Bring extra snacks for both friends and family! A MUST HAVE TRAVEL & TO-GO FOOD ACCESSORY: A perfect gift for yourself, a loved one, a coworker, a nurse, a teacher… for any important lady in your life! We stand 110% beyond our lunch bags and offer the longest warranty on the market!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813eBKUiu1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ASEBBO","source_asin":"B0C5CX1XJC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-997454","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5CX1XJC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5CX1XJC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
