window.products.push({"id":997634,"name":"Evaporative Cooler, MCBL 1100CFM Air Cooler, 120°Oscillation Swamp Cooler with Remote Control, 24H Timer, 3 Wind Speeds for Outdoor Indoor Use,3.9 Gal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613cJbqP2AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Need a quick relief from the heat? Our portable MCBL Evaporative Air Cooler got your back to keep you cool over the summer. This indoor swamp cooler is designed to conveniently cool a room with up to 220 square feet dimension and has a tank container that allows you to add up to 15-liter of ice water for extra coolness. Our high-quality air cooling machine is smartly designed with an LED display control panel and includes a handy remote control to easily set the time, swing direction, temperature, speed, and mode from across the room. Choose your preferred power level from Low, Mid, and High. Sleep, or Normal wind mode? There’s always one that is perfect for you. What’s cooler than being cool? This 14.2 x 16.4 x 34.4 inches space-saving evaporative cooler with oscillating vents for faster and even air distribution only uses water to cool the air, unlike traditional air conditioners that use heavy compressors or refrigerant gas. Our cooler increases humidity to help you feel more comfortable. No worries if you don’t want to leave the cooler running while you’re asleep as we designed our evaporative cooler with a 24-hour programmable timer that you can easily set to help save energy by turning the unit on and off automatically. Also designed with a visible and audible low-water indicator to easily monitor the water level of your cooler. To provide clean cool air for your optimum relaxation and comfort, we designed a removable and reusable nylon air filter to protect your family and living space from dust and pet hairs. To extend the life and performance of this unit, we recommend you to clean the filter every week of operation. Simply slide the filter out and clean with mild detergent and a soft brush.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613cJbqP2AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MCBL","source_asin":"B09SCCNNTX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-997634","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SCCNNTX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SCCNNTX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
