window.products.push({"id":997796,"name":"4 Pack Silicone Ice Cube Trays with Lid, Easy-Release Ice Cube Molds, 56 Cavities Small Square Ice Tray BPA Free Nontoxic and Safe, Stackable Durable ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AbtTpiOvL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【4 Ice Cube Trays with Lid】 Our ice cube trays are stackable and space-saving. Every tray comes with an easy-to-remove lid which can efficiently prevent spills and keep ice cubes from absorbing freezer odors. 【Food Grade Safety Material & Dishwasher Safe】- Get 4 in 1 package!!! You receive 2-pack blue ice molds and 2-pack green molds. Made of food grade silicone, our ice cube trays are 100% BPA free keep your ice safe for drinking. Our Ice cubes guarantee safety and durability, which can be used for adult & baby food. After using, you can easily put them in your dishwasher. 【Effortless Ice Release & Clean】- The bottom of each well is made of soft non-stick silicon, which makes it easy to release ice cubes. Each flat cube compartment is separate from others so you can easily push from the bottom. Do not need to bend or twist the ice cube tray awkwardly! If you want to remove them easily, run hot water over the bottom of the trays. It's a trick. In addition, the smooth silicone surface and independent slot design make it easy to clean. 【Stackable Removable Lid & Compact Design】- Each tray includes a lid that keeps the ice clean and making it ideal for stacking on top of each other. These ice cube tray size is 9.92 x 3.90 x 1.14 inches, the compact size allows the space saving storage set to fit nicely in any home refrigerator, RV or dorm mini fridge and free from freezing odors. Moreover tiny grids, make quick freezing and fast chilling, taking up less time freezing into ice cube and chilling your drink, no more waiting. 【Warm Tips】- Some buyers has reflected that it is difficult to take out ice cubes from the tray after freezing. It is recommended leaving on for 1-2 minutes after taking out the ice cubes from the refrigerator. When the ice cubes melt slightly (doesn't affect the food serving quality at all), then bend the ice tray towards the back side to remove the ice cubes. Press the back of tray with your fingers if necessary. It can help you take out all the mini ice cubes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AbtTpiOvL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YD YD XINHUA","source_asin":"B07NY571QR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-997796","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NY571QR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NY571QR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
