window.products.push({"id":997816,"name":"Paddywax Apothecary Soy Wax Scented Candle, 8-Ounce Glass Jar with Lid, Orange Zest & Bergamot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7178udApsyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With our apothecary-jar collection of scented soy wax candles, you can responsibly fill your space with clean, fresh, natural candles that make any house feel like a home! Choose from amazing scents like a verbena and eucalyptus candle, a smoke and amber candle, a tobacco and patchouli candle, a sea salt and sage candle, an orange zest and bergamot candle, a vetiver and cardamom candle, a teak and tobacco candle, or a persimmon chestnut candle. Each artisan candle from the Apothecary candle set offers a rich tapestry of top, middle, and base scents to form a memorable fragrance.All of our aromatic candles are poured into recyclable glass jars to help you make every aspect of your life more earth-friendly. From the simple, reusable glass containers to the beautiful accents that complement your home, our long-lasting scented soy candles create a look that blends in and a smell that stands out. Use one as a bathroom candle, a kitchen candle, or a living-room candle to bring a welcoming aroma to any room in your home. Be sure to trim the wick before a new burn for a contained flame and an even burn.Every aspect of Paddywax candles—from the materials to the shapes—is designed in Nashville, Tennessee. Each pretty candle is hand poured at our Nashville factory, where we combine the soy wax blend with a lovely fragrance and a safe cotton wick so that it will burn beautifully. After you finish burning your long-lasting scented candle, freeze the glass jar overnight to remove the wax and wick. You can use the clean container as a succulent planter, a pencil cup, a bowl, a sugar container, a knickknack holder, a bathroom canister, or a laundry-bead holder. The possibilities are endless!Paddywax is an artisan company specializing in candles and diffusers made with quality materials, inspiring color palettes, and intriguing fragrances to set the tone in your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7178udApsyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Paddywax","source_asin":"B09HXVNHT8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-997816","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HXVNHT8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HXVNHT8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
